<title>ESTONIA: Estonia consumer prices fall 0.3 percent in Aug.</title>
<headline>Estonia consumer prices fall 0.3 percent in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's consumer prices fell by 0.3 percent in August against a 0.4 percent rise in July for a year-on-year rise of 21.9 percent, the country's statistics department said on Friday.</p>
<p> ESTONIA CONSUMER PRICES	 Aug 96    July 96   Aug 95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)    -0.3	 +0.4	+0.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)     +21.9	+23.00    +27.3</p>
<p> Index				    NA	   NA	 NA</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +3717-22 66 93</p>
